[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2661572597","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100458#issuecomment-2661572597","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100458","id":2661572597,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6epF_1","user":{"login":"Dorifor","id":28139590,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4MTM5NTkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28139590?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dorifor","html_url":"https://github.com/Dorifor","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dorifor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dorifor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dorifor/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dorifor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dorifor/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dorifor/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dorifor/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dorifor/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dorifor/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-16T19:04:43Z","updated_at":"2025-02-16T19:04:43Z","body":"Can confirm the same behaviour on `Godot v4.4.beta3 (96cdbbe5b) - Windows 11 (build 26100)`\n\nAfter a bit of investigation, I found out : \n\n- It's not caused by `EditorExportPlugin` specifically, it also crashes in a basic script (in that case it crashed the runtime only)\n- It's because of the `PackedStringArray` type declaration for your EXCLUDED_DIRECTORIES Dictionary\n- For some reason constants are treated as 'null' when debugging with Godot (may explain some weird behaviour)\n\nAs a workaround, you can either : \n- Remove your type declaration for EXCLUDED_DIRECTORIES \n- Replace your `PackedStringArray` type with an `Array` type\n\nI don't know how to fix this. Hope someone can make sense of this.\n\nAlso, I found another bug while investigating, it may be linked: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102926","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2661572597/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3593204702","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100458#issuecomment-3593204702","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100458","id":3593204702,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7WK_Pe","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-30T19:43:31Z","updated_at":"2025-11-30T19:43:31Z","body":"* Probably a duplicate of #88753.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3593204702/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"hear